      "text": "Since evals will take\ntime, we expect to\nuse overlapping evals\nto allow more\ncontinuous training",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Since evals will take time, we expect to use overlapping evals to allow more continuous training",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BgrkVYHksJfVyeY4M2dcp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -752.4387699762825,
      "y": -1748.7783660294008,
